        <mxCell id="YbmKh844nZtWCoRyA18e-17" value="&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Client sends a request to Client agent (adk)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Client agent says hey! you gave me a remote agent (localhost:10001), I am using A2A protocol, I can do 2 things&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Check to see what agents I have available , lookup the agent cards&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Can see Hey! agent What can you do?&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Intiate the Message&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;message send to the server&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;message send to the Agent Executor&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;execute method of executor calls the proper agent&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Wheather agent return the response as a message&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
